id: STYLE-042
ilities: [modifiability]
source: cpm
maturity: 4
action: advisory
title: ASCII banner/separator comments
category: style
severity: info
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .ts .js .jsx .tsx .py .java .kt .cs .go .rb .c .cpp .h
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ vendor/ node_modules/ .git/ build/ dist/
patterns:
  - regex: //\s*[=\-\*#]{10,}
    message: "Banner/separator comment — indicates the file is doing too many things. Consider splitting into modules."
  - regex: #\s*[=\-\*]{10,}
    message: "Banner comment — suggests the file handles multiple concerns. Split into focused modules."
fix: If you need visual separators, the file is probably too long. Extract sections into separate modules.
